 $A,$ then the pseudoinverse of $A$ is given by\n\n$$\nV\\,{Σ}^{+}\\,{U}^{T},\n$$\n\nwhere ${Σ}^{+}$ is the pseudoinverse of $Σ.$\n\nFirst, notice that\n\n$$\nV=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,{Σ}^{+}=\\frac{1}{5\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,{U}^{T}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & \\sqrt{5} \\\\ -2 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{+} & =V\\,{Σ}^{+}\\,{U}^{T} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\frac{1}{5\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & \\sqrt{5} \\\\ -2 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{50}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & \\sqrt{5} \\\\ 2 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{50}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & \\sqrt{5} \\\\ -2 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{50}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 6 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186420789 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0755beb3-73a6-5399-8b09-ddef07ddf09d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{20}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186420759} {:answer/id #uuid "32b39ef8-9dd6-57b9-ab9a-17113d1beb75" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{25}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186420764} {:answer/id #uuid "579ce615-12df-5c19-81bd-6fbd6731105e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{10}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186420770} {:answer/id #uuid "8